      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This phenomenon is likely due to the fact that the Cloth component remembers and manipulates the mesh shape as soon as it is Enabled.\n\nAfter changing the avatar's scale, when the Cloth component of the animation was momentarily set to Disable and then back to Enable, the Cloth mesh also matched the changed size.\n\nIt would be a good idea to provide a trigger for the avatar to know that the scale has changed, or to add a process to automatically recalculate the mesh shape in the Cloth component when the avatar's scale is changed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
