      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Cloth scaling properly with avatar was working but now with this latest update, its broken and even resetting avatar don't fix it 100% of the time, but then you lose your avatar's scaled height too. and when you reset avatar height it applied the previous scaled cloth.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
